          "short": "$-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{p-q}{q-p}&=\\frac{p-q}{-(p-q)}\\\\&=-1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
